  $translations['nl:default']['ae5470703d6f8508dfbf715bd4505bd7'] = array(
    'source' => '[user:name],

Thank you for registering at [site:name]. You may now log in by clicking this link or copying and pasting it to your browser:

[user:one-time-login-url]

This link can only be used once to log in and will lead you to a page where you can set your password.

After setting your password, you will be able to log in at [site:login-url] in the future using:

username: [user:name]
password: Your password

--  [site:name] team',
    'context' => '',
    'location' => '',
    'translation' => 'Hallo [user:name],

Dank u voor het registreren voor [site:url]. U kunt nu inloggen door op onderstaande link te klikken of deze te kopiëren en te plakken in de adresbalk van uw browser:

[user:one-time-login-url]

Deze link kan éénmalig worden gebruikt en zal u leiden naar een pagina waar u uw wachtwoord kunt instellen. Na het instellen van uw wachtwoord kunt u in de toekomst inloggen op [site:login-url] met de volgende gegevens:

Gebruikersnaam: [user:name]
Wachtwoord: het door u ingestelde wachtwoord

[site:name]',
    'plid' => 0,
    'plural' => 0,
  );
  $translatables[] = t('[user:name],

Thank you for registering at [site:name]. You may now log in by clicking this link or copying and pasting it to your browser:

[user:one-time-login-url]

This link can only be used once to log in and will lead you to a page where you can set your password.

After setting your password, you will be able to log in at [site:login-url] in the future using:

username: [user:name]
password: Your password

--  [site:name] team', array(), array('context' => ''));
